   "text": "Norges Bank and Digdir arranged a brainstorming session on 22 November 2022. The theme was which existing problems a CBDC can solve, and which new opportunities a CBDC can provide to society. The same day started a technical hackathon, with groups programming solutions in Norges Bank's prototype.",
   "lang": "en",
